abstract: >-
  A searchable, interactive literature map of papers responding to the
  LUX-ZEPLIN 248 keV nuclear-recoil candidate announced on 1 September 2026.
  The archive contains the website source, reviewed paper catalogue,
  machine-assisted summaries, physics taxonomy, citation relationships,
  and reproducible map layouts. The software is licensed under MIT;
  original summaries and documentation are licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  Third-party material retains its existing rights; see LICENSE-CONTENT.md.
